__pycache__/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
context-bundle.md

# Generated repo-context receipts: timestamped snapshots plus a `latest.json`
# pointer, written by tooling that captures repo state (schema_version,
# git_remote, current_branch, ...). Same class of generated context artifact as
# `context-bundle.md` above, and it reappears in every working tree that runs
# the capture.
#
# Scoped to the subdirectory rather than all of `receipts/`: this is the part
# verified to be generated, and a blanket rule would silently hide a future
# receipt type that is meant to be committed.
receipts/repo-context/
